Z||000003||Songman||04-10-2001||08:32 AM||||Glad you like it, Carl. I have been thinking about this for a long time and just never actually sat down to figure it out. I didn't know I was going to like it so much after I saw it! Your car worked out perfectly for the test.<P>We'll have to be on the lookout for some kind of car with taillights that we could use. I really would love to build a car just like this... Guess I'm gonna have to take a course in 'glass work.<P>I can't take credit for the cool little Euro front quarter lights. The 88 T-top car that I am getting from FieroGTguy has them. I guess they were his idea, taken from European cars.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||7
